WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.520
On Wishonia, when we wanted to redirect resources from destruction to medicine, we just did it.

2
00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:14.020
The entire process took about a week. We didn't need lawyers because we didn't have lawyers, which is one of the main reasons

3
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:22.050
it only took a week. On Earth, saving lives requires written permission from several governments, a tax classification,

4
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:30.080
a securities exemption, and the approval of a regulatory body named after the thing it fails to regulate.

5
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:37.620
Your Securities and Exchange Commission regulates securities, not security.

6
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:47.650
Your Department of Defense mainly attacks people. Your Department of Justice is where justice goes to take a very long nap.

7
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:53.740
I have studied your laws for eighty years. They are not designed to prevent wrongdoing.

8
00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:01.400
They are designed to ensure that wrongdoing happens in the correct font, on the correct form, filed in the correct jurisdiction.

9
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.980
Once the paperwork is in order, your species will permit almost anything.

10
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:14.360
This is not a criticism. It is the design parameter that makes everything in this chapter possible.

11
00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:24.000
What follows is the legal architecture for curing disease using your own ridiculous laws, which is to say, using your laws

12
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:31.200
exactly as written, just not as intended. On your planet, that's the most legal thing there is.

13
00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:38.320
Entity number one: Your five hundred and one (c) (three) Public Charity ("The Brain").

14
00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:45.840
This is your standard nonprofit. The kind that lets the Gates Foundation give you tax-deductible money, which is money the

15
00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:52.860
government pretends it never saw, as a reward for doing something the government should have done itself but couldn't because

16
00:01:52.860 --> 00:02:01.580
it was busy buying bombers. The Brain runs your global referendum, which is a non-binding educational survey showing two

17
00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:10.620
hundred and eighty million plus humans want to not die. It funds academic studies proving your system is broken (studies

18
00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:17.480
that, I should note, nobody will dispute because the system is obviously broken and everyone knows it; you need the studies

19
00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:23.560
anyway because your species does not act on things it knows until a university confirms them).

20
00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:28.080
It runs public awareness campaigns like this manual you're reading right now.

21
00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:33.020
And it builds software, including your decentralized F.D.A.

22
00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:39.200
and Wishocracy, which are the tools that eventually replace the grant-writing machine with something that works.

23
00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:48.860
What it cannot do is lobby politicians (mostly). A five hundred and one (c) (three) can do limited lobbying under the "no

24
00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:53.400
substantial part" test, but it's easier to let the next entity handle it.

25
00:02:54.180 --> 00:03:01.040
On your planet, there's a legal distinction between "teaching people facts" and "suggesting people act on those facts."

26
00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:07.220
It means nothing in practice, but the I.R.S. cares deeply about it, and the I.R.S.

27
00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:11.300
is the one organization on Earth less fun to argue with than death.

28
00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:17.180
Why a U.S. five hundred and one (c) (three)? Because it unlocks foundation grants.

29
00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:23.440
A non-binding educational survey is clearly educational. The clue is in the name.

30
00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:31.140
Entity number two: Your five hundred and one (c) (four) Social Welfare Org ("The Sword").

31
00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:38.320
This is your political advocacy arm. Donations are NOT tax-deductible, which is the price of being allowed to have opinions.

32
00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:42.340
On your planet, having opinions about where money goes costs money.

33
00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:47.100
Not having opinions is free. This explains a great deal about your civilization.

34
00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:55.360
The Sword takes the referendum results from your Brain and weaponizes them: unlimited lobbying, voter mobilization of two

35
00:03:55.360 --> 00:04:02.160
hundred and eighty million plus referendum participants, and the kind of political pressure that makes politicians sweat

36
00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:09.540
through their suits. Your species invented an organizational form specifically for telling politicians what to do.

37
00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:16.680
Then you made a different form for everything else. Then you made it illegal for the two forms to talk to each other, except

38
00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:20.660
through carefully worded press releases, which is how they talk to each other.

39
00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:25.080
Entity number three: The Victory Corporation ("The Engine").

40
00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:32.430
This is a standard for-profit corporation. Designed to speak the only language Wall Street understands, which is money.

41
00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:40.620
Other languages Wall Street claims to understand include "sustainability," "stakeholder value," and "corporate responsibility,"

42
00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:47.800
but it's been faking comprehension of these for decades and nobody has noticed, or rather everyone has noticed and nobody

43
00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:55.220
has cared, which on your planet is the same thing. The Engine issues VICTORY Bonds (two hundred and seventy-two percent

44
00:04:55.220 --> 00:05:03.580
target returns), uses one billion dollars to fund lobbying and campaigns, and manages treaty inflows to pay bondholders

45
00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:09.540
in perpetuity. It is, in short, the part that makes rich people richer for making sick people better.

46
00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:16.420
On Wishonia, this arrangement would be considered bizarre. On Earth, it's the only arrangement that produces results.

47
00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:24.220
Why Delaware? More corporations than humans live there. Your Supreme Court decided that companies are people who can talk,

48
00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:30.240
and talking is spending money. This sounds like satire but is actually constitutional law.

49
00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:37.240
Delaware has made itself the place where imaginary people go to be born, which is a sentence that sounds like it was written

50
00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:42.380
by a mentally unwell person but is in fact a precise description of American corporate law.

51
00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:48.200
Entity number four: Your Decentralized Institutes of Health Foundation ("The Soul").

52
00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:55.420
This is the parent organization. Based in Switzerland, where your species keeps its most valuable things and its least valuable

53
00:05:55.420 --> 00:06:01.860
opinions. The Swiss have avoided war for over one hundred and seventy-five years by holding everyone's money.

54
00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:08.700
Even Hitler couldn't make them pick a side. If you're building something designed to survive hostile governments, put it

55
00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:12.540
in the country that survived all of them by being too useful to invade.

56
00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:19.280
The Foundation owns one hundred percent of Victory Corporation, ensuring profit serves mission instead of the other way

57
00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:26.320
around (which is what happens when you don't do this, as demonstrated by every hospital chain, insurance company, and pharmaceutical

58
00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:33.760
firm that started with noble intentions and ended up maximizing shareholder value, which is corporate for "forgetting why

59
00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:41.800
you exist"). It accepts international grants. Its legal charter is permanently locked to ending war and disease, which means

60
00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:47.260
no future board can wake up one morning and decide the real mission was luxury condos all along.

61
00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:54.600
And it sits in a neutral jurisdiction for treaty coordination, because coordinating an international treaty from a country

62
00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:59.960
that is party to the treaty is like refereeing a football game in which you're also the quarterback.

63
00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:08.160
Why One Organization Pretending to Be Four. Each entity does only what's perfectly legal in its jurisdiction.

64
00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.740
Combined, they do what's impossible with a single structure.

65
00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:19.580
This is like a relay team where each runner is only allowed to run on a specific type of surface, so you need four runners

66
00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:27.340
for four surfaces, and the baton is billions of dollars. The firewalls matter more than the entities themselves.

67
00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:32.160
Charitable funds never touch political operations (the I.R.S.

68
00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:36.720
is watching). Political funds never touch bond proceeds (the S.E.C.

69
00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:41.160
is watching). International funds stay firewalled from U.S.

70
00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:46.900
political spending (the F.E.C. is watching). Separate bank accounts, separate staff, separate lawyers.

71
00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:54.940
Everyone watches everyone. This is called "compliance" and it's the most expensive form of distrust your species has invented,

72
00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:59.920
which is saying something, because your species has invented a lot of expensive distrust.

73
00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:05.480
The A.C.L.U., N.R.A., and Planned Parenthood use this same structure.

74
00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:09.390
It works for protecting gun rights, reproductive rights, and civil liberties.

75
00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:13.700
You just haven't pointed it at disease yet. The General Staff.

76
00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:20.120
Victory Corporation employs your core team, raises your capital, and executes your strategy.

77
00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:25.060
Your species spent thousands of years perfecting how to coordinate mass killing.

78
00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:32.400
Time to plagiarize that homework for the opposite purpose. The organizational structure borrows from your military, because

79
00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:40.960
your military is the only institution on Earth that has successfully coordinated millions of humans toward a single objective,

80
00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:49.120
even if that objective was the wrong one. G One handles personnel (keeping track of humans, which is harder than it sounds).

81
00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:57.740
G Two handles disease intelligence (deciding which diseases die next, which is a sentence your species should have been

82
00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:02.380
saying for decades but wasn't because nobody was coordinating).

83
00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:07.860
G Three handles operations, running your decentralized F.D.A.

84
00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:12.540
clinical trials, which is the only part that actually cures anything.

85
00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:22.100
G Four handles logistics and treasury, managing your VICTORY Bond money (counting it, moving it, resisting the urge to steal

86
00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:25.700
it, which requires a surprising amount of institutional design).

87
00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:33.540
G Five handles plans and strategy, thinking about next year while everyone else panics about next quarter.

88
00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:41.400
And G Six handles signal and communications, which is propaganda, which is the reason you're reading this instead of doing

89
00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:49.720
something useful. The Foundation watches the Victory Corporation to make sure it doesn't drift toward maximizing shareholder

90
00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:57.840
value, which is corporate for "forgetting why you exist." This happens to every for-profit entity eventually.

91
00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:06.740
It's like entropy but for mission statements. The only defense is a nonprofit owner with a locked charter and a very long

92
00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:16.740
memory. Securities Law (A Section Named After Oranges). VICTORY Incentive Alignment Bonds are securities under the Howey

93
00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:24.800
Test, a legal test named after a citrus company. Your entire securities regulation framework traces back to a man selling

94
00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:32.640
oranges in Florida. This is, genuinely, how the most powerful economy on Earth decides what money is.

95
00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:40.980
On Wishonia, we find this charming in the way that you find a child's drawing charming: it's technically wrong but it clearly

96
00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:50.400
means well. The plan: start with Regulation D (rich people only, because your laws allow rich people to lose money on speculative

97
00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:57.880
investments but protect poor people from the opportunity to make money on speculative investments, which your species calls

98
00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:03.080
"investor protection" and I call "a very specific kind of cruelty").

99
00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:09.580
Expand to Regulation crowdfunding, or C.F., and A Plus (everyone else).

100
00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:14.320
Full know your customer and anti-money laundering, or K.Y.C.

101
00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:22.360
A.M.L., compliance throughout, because you need to verify that nobody uses your disease-curing bonds to launder money from

102
00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:29.860
their disease-causing enterprises, which is a real concern given that several of your largest industries do both simultaneously.

103
00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:40.100
Election Law (A Section About Legal Bribery). Bribing politicians is illegal unless you call it "lobbying" or "campaign

104
00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:47.860
contributions." Then it's protected speech. Your First Amendment protects the right to petition your government, which your

105
00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:55.660
Supreme Court interpreted as "spend unlimited money telling politicians what to do", which is a reading of the text that

106
00:11:55.660 --> 00:12:04.040
the text's authors would find creative in the way that a teacher finds a student's excuse creative when the dog allegedly

107
00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:12.520
ate the homework. The one rule your species enforces seriously: foreign nationals can't spend money on U.S.

108
00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:16.630
elections. Violating this gets you federal prison, not a fine.

109
00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:23.300
American money touches American elections. International money touches everything else.

110
00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:32.320
They never mix. This is the one firewall where your species chose prison over paperwork, which tells you exactly how much

111
00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:39.460
your politicians care about foreign influence compared to how much they care about domestic corruption (domestic corruption:

112
00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:47.340
fine; foreign corruption: prison; the corruption itself: identical; the distinction: nationalism).

113
00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:56.120
For the full details on Super PACs, the foreign national firewall, and international compliance, see Election Law.

114
00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:02.440
Treaty Framework. The one percent Treaty is a formal international agreement.

115
00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:11.300
Like the ones your species already signs about postal rates and fish, except this one redirects military spending to clinical

116
00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:18.140
trials. Apparently more controversial than fish, which tells you everything about your species' priorities.

117
00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:25.640
For the full treaty structure, ratification process, and enforcement mechanisms, see one percent Treaty.

118
00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:35.580
Risk Mitigation (When They Come For You). When you threaten trillion-dollar industries by curing disease cheaply, powerful

119
00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:40.920
people notice. They notice the way a bear notices you've sat on its children.

120
00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:49.020
The question is not whether they'll attack. The question is which attack vector they'll use first, and whether your lawyers

121
00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:55.780
bill more per hour than theirs, which is how legal disputes are actually decided on your planet, despite what they teach

122
00:13:55.820 --> 00:14:04.420
in law school. Securities fraud is the obvious one. Your defense: full compliance from day one, in multiple jurisdictions,

123
00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:09.930
documented so thoroughly that investigating you feels like auditing a library.

124
00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:18.500
Election law violations are the second. Your defense: complete segregation of funds, plus a constitutional challenge ready

125
00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:24.780
to file, because money is speech and your Supreme Court said so, and once your Supreme Court says something it stays said

126
00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:29.360
for decades regardless of whether it makes sense. Tax evasion is the third.

127
00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:38.820
Your defense: pay every penny, voluntarily, enthusiastically, more compliantly than churches, and nobody audits churches.

128
00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:44.290
RICO and conspiracy charges are the fourth, and the most creative.

129
00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:51.320
Your defense: everything is public. This manual is public. You're reading the conspiracy right now.

130
00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:57.860
It's hard to prosecute a plan published in paperback, distributed globally, and available in audiobook format for people

131
00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:05.940
who prefer their conspiracies read aloud. The broader strategy is simple: top firms in every jurisdiction, former regulators

132
00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:12.560
on retainer (they wrote the rules, so they know where the rules get tired and stop paying attention), and compliance so

133
00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:19.340
perfect that investigating you produces nothing except billable hours for your opponents' lawyers, who will eventually tell

134
00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:24.000
their clients to stop because the meter is running and the library is boring.

135
00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:29.400
Follow every rule so perfectly that nobody martyrs the boring.

136
00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:37.720
Boring is your best defense. Your species has a long history of persecuting the interesting and ignoring the tedious.

137
00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:45.640
Be tedious. Be so tedious that the prosecutors fall asleep before they find anything, and when they wake up, the treaty

138
00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:52.860
has already passed, and the diseases are already being cured, and the money is already flowing, and by the time anyone objects,

139
00:15:53.380 --> 00:16:00.140
objecting would mean taking medicine away from sick people, which is the one thing your politicians cannot do on camera.

140
00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:07.100
If the courts fail anyway, you have international arbitration, regulatory capture (former S.E.C.

141
00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:14.060
commissioners are surprisingly affordable, like vintage furniture), and two hundred and eighty million referendum participants

142
00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:23.100
who make politicians reconsider their entire careers. This entire strategy uses the exact same legal structures that currently

143
00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:30.760
enable tax avoidance, dark money, and corporate welfare. The tools of corruption, repurposed for medicine.

144
00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:35.140
The loopholes meant for billionaires will fund medicine for billions.

145
00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:43.220
Your species built a legal system with more loopholes than walls, and then acted surprised when people walked through the

146
00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:45.840
loopholes. The surprise is not that loopholes exist. The surprise is that nobody walked through them carrying medicine until

147
00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:53.440
now. Legal Disclaimer (The Part Your Lawyers Insisted On) This chapter is not legal advice.

148
00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:58.770
Hire lawyers who understand that "legal" and "unprecedented" are not mutually exclusive.

149
00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:02.380
If your lawyers tell you this can't be done, get better lawyers.
